\title{Gradient Boosting Learner with Streaming Data Access}
\description{
A \link[mlr3:LearnerRegr]{mlr3::LearnerRegr} for LightGBM that reads a
\link{DataBackendParquet} backed by DuckDB and streams batches into the
LightGBM C API.  The binned dataset is built in C++ with
\code{LGBM_DatasetCreateFromSampledColumn()} + \code{LGBM_DatasetPushRowsWithMetadata()};
no CSV and no full feature matrix are materialised.

For other backends, such as the in-memory output of \code{mlr3pipelines}, the
learner converts the current task to a temporary Parquet file once per
train or predict call, retaining factor levels, column roles and task
metadata.
}
